{
  "version": 1,
  "pathPrefix": "story-sharing/",
  "rule": { "read": false, "write": false },
  "freeTierCanaryFallback": {
    "platformPreset": "creator-only",
    "effectiveRule": {
      "read": "resource.openid == auth.openid",
      "write": "resource.openid == auth.openid"
    },
    "requiredServerControls": [
      "cloud-function-created-object",
      "random-128-bit-attempt-path",
      "server-only-asset-record",
      "authorization-recheck-before-temporary-url",
      "five-minute-maximum-requested-url-ttl"
    ]
  },
  "note": "付费套餐可把 story-sharing/ 前缀直接设为客户端不可读写。免费环境不支持自定义前缀规则时，仅允许受控单家庭灰度使用 creator-only 全桶预设：真实副本必须由云函数写入不可预测路径，并经私有资产记录、当前授权复核后签发最多 300 秒的临时 URL。客户端自行上传到相同前缀的文件没有私有资产记录，不能进入读取或导出链路。现有照片规则不得放宽。跨身份素材复制、清理和真实 TTL 仍须真机验收。"
}
